 The game received multiple sequels, including Chaos on Deponia (2012), Goodbye Deponia (2013), and Deponia Doomsday (2016).","title":"Deponia (video game)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deponia_(video_game)","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"desktop-soccer-switch":{"id":"desktop-soccer-switch","developers":[]},"destinys-princess-a-war-story-a-love-story-switch":{"id":"destinys-princess-a-war-story-a-love-story-switch","developers":["Dogenzaka Lab"]},"disney-epic-mickey-rebrushed-switch":{"id":"disney-epic-mickey-rebrushed-switch","developers":["Purple Lamp"],"opencriticId":"17335"},"elden-path-of-the-forgotten-switch":{"id":"elden-path-of-the-forgotten-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"9771"},"evans-remains-switch":{"id":"evans-remains-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"9599"},"exit-the-gungeon-switch":{"id":"exit-the-gungeon-switch","developers":["Dodge Roll"],"opencriticId":"9190"},"fairune-collection-switch":{"id":"fairune-collection-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"6060"},"farm-manager-2022-switch":{"id":"farm-manager-2022-switch","developers":["Cleversan Games"],"series":["Farm Manager"],"opencriticId":"13140"},"fly-together-switch":{"id":"fly-together-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"11233"},"gal-gun-double-peace-switch":{"id":"gal-gun-double-peace-switch","developers":["Inti Creates"],"series":["Gal★Gun"],"opencriticId":"2965"},"hashihime-of-the-old-book-town-append-switch":{"id":"hashihime-of-the-old-book-town-append-switch","developers":["HuneX"],"opencriticId":"12564"},"i-am-dead-switch":{"id":"i-am-dead-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"10236"},"i-am-setsuna-switch":{"id":"i-am-setsuna-switch","developers":["Tokyo RPG Factory"],"opencriticId":"2879","wikipedia":{"en":{"text":"I am Setsuna is a 2016 role-playing video game developed by Tokyo RPG Factory and published by Square Enix for PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita and Microsoft Windows. A version for the Nintendo Switch was released in 2017 as a console launch title. The storyline, set in a snow-bound world plagued by monsters, follows silent protagonist Endir as he becomes the guardian of Setsuna, a young woman destined to be a sacrifice for pacifying the world's monsters. The gameplay, designed to emulate titles from the genre's \"golden age\", uses an Active Time Battle system.","title":"I am Setsuna","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_am_Setsuna","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"kitty-maestro-switch":{"id":"kitty-maestro-switch","developers":[]},"kuso-switch":{"id":"kuso-switch","developers":[]},"merrily-perilly-switch":{"id":"merrily-perilly-switch","developers":["Squiddershins"],"opencriticId":"11648"},"mxgp3-the-official-motocross-videogame-switch":{"id":"mxgp3-the-official-motocross-videogame-switch","developers":["Milestone S.r.l."],"series":["MXGP"],"opencriticId":"4419"},"my-friend-pedro-switch":{"id":"my-friend-pedro-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"7903","wikipedia":{"en":{"text":"My Friend Pedro is a 2019 run and gun video game developed by Swedish developer DeadToast Entertainment and published by Devolver Digital. The game was released for Nintendo Switch and Windows on 20 June 2019 and for Xbox One on 5 December 2019. A PlayStation 4 port of the game was released on 2 April 2020. My Friend Pedro is based on an Adobe Flash game named MFP: My Friend Pedro that was released by Adult Swim Games in 2014.","title":"My Friend Pedro","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Friend_Pedro","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"nekopara-vol-1-switch":{"id":"nekopara-vol-1-switch","developers":["NEKO WORKs"],"series":["Nekopara"],"opencriticId":"2425"},"nickelodeon-kart-racers-3-slime-speedway-switch":{"id":"nickelodeon-kart-racers-3-slime-speedway-switch","developers":["Bamtang Games"],"series":["Nickelodeon Kart Racers"],"opencriticId":"13752"},"onsen-master-switch":{"id":"onsen-master-switch","developers":["Waking Oni Games"],"opencriticId":"14641"},"ori-and-the-blind-forest-definitive-edition-switch":{"id":"ori-and-the-blind-forest-definitive-edition-switch","developers":["Moon Studios"],"series":["Ori"],"opencriticId":"829","wikipedia":{"en":{"text":"Ori and the Blind Forest is a Metroidvania video game developed by Moon Studios and published by Microsoft Studios. The game was released for Windows and Xbox One in March 2015, and for Nintendo Switch in September 2019. Players assume control of Ori, a small white spirit, and Sein, the \"light and eyes\" of the Forest's Spirit Tree. Players are tasked to move between platforms and solve puzzles. The game features a save system called \"Soul Links\", which allows players to save their progress at will with limited resources, and an upgrade system that allows players to strengthen Ori's skills and abilities.","title":"Ori and the Blind Forest","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ori_and_the_Blind_Forest","asOf":"2026-11-21"},"ar":{"text":"أوري والغابة العمياء هي لعبة منصات مغامرات طورتها استديوهات مون ونشرتها مايكروسوفت ستوديوز. أُصدرت اللعبة على منصتي ويندوز و‌إكس بوكس ون في مارس 2015. في اللعبة يتحكم اللاعب بشخصية أوري (Ori) - روح حارسة بيضاء - وسين (Sein) - «ضوء وعينيّ» شجرة أرواح الغابة. للتقدم في اللعبة، اللاعبون مكلفون بالتحرك بين المنصات وحل الألغاز. تتميز اللعبة بنظام يسمى «روابط الروح» ، والذي يسمح للاعبين بالحفظ في «الإرادة»، وهو نظام ترقية يعطي اللاعبين القدرة على تقوية مهارات أوري.","title":"أوري أند ذا بلايند فورست","url":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%A3%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%8A_%D8%A3%D9%86%D8%AF_%D8%B0%D8%A7_%D8%A8%D9%84%D8%A7%D9%8A%D9%86%D8%AF_%D9%81%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%B3%D8%AA","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"overloop-switch":{"id":"overloop-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"14552"},"parking-simulator-switch":{"id":"parking-simulator-switch","developers":[]},"puzzle-puppers-switch":{"id":"puzzle-puppers-switch","developers":["Cardboard Keep"],"opencriticId":"3906"},"qbik-switch":{"id":"qbik-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"5562"},"radiation-city-switch":{"id":"radiation-city-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"7890"},"robothorium-swi